- R | throw out the training plans and take up dancing, for the joy of it | v: hedonism, stimulation | chance: 70
- G | accept a slower body, and find the walks and the days that suit it | v: tradition, security | chance: 80
works: Slowly {N} gets back some strength, and the stairs stop being a climb.
works: {N} makes peace with the race, and the illness settles down again.
fails: The weakness lingers through the year, and {N} stops trying to beat it.
fails: {N} grows short with everyone who asks about the race.

== bold: a season in the family's hands / G
base: accept a slower body, and find the walks and the days that suit it
likelier_if: mark 'came home' +10
- G | put yourself in the family's hands for a season, and let them nurse you back | v: tradition, security | act: put themselves in the family's hands for a season, to be nursed back to strength | chance: 35 | requires: family who will always take you in | grants: keeping fit | takes_if_fails: family who will always take you in
works: Home cooking, early nights and the family's fussing do their work, and by the season's end {N} is fit enough to train again.
works: {N} walks the hill behind the house every morning, and comes back strong, with running shoes on.
fails: Old rows come back within a month, {N} leaves on bad terms, and the door at home is no longer open.
fails: The fussing turns to quarrels, {N} walks out, and the welcome the family once kept for {N} is gone.

# ================================================================ robbed or attacked in the street

== bold: robbed or attacked in the street / B
base: make yourself a hard target: never alone, never lost, never soft
likelier_if: has [organising people] +10; has [neighbour who has your back] +5
- B | get a crew together, and walk the station every night until it is yours again | v: power, security | act: get a crew together and walk the station every night until it is theirs again | chance: 40 | grants: crew that has your back | drops_if_fails: kind:community
works: Night after night the crew walks the bridge with torches and phones, the robbers move on, and the people beside {N} would go anywhere for each other.
works: By winter the station is quiet, and {N} has a crew of night walkers who pick up the phone at any hour.
fails: The crew starts stopping strangers, the police are called on them, and {N} is asked to step down from every group on the street.
fails: One night the patrol picks on the wrong lad, the street turns against it, and {N} gives up every club and group {N} belonged to.

== bold: robbed or attacked in the street / W
base: report it at once, give a full statement, and see it through to court
likelier_if: mark 'kept your word' +10; has [public speaking] +5
- W | stand up in court as the witness, and name them with their friends in the gallery | v: conformity, universalism | act: stand up in court as the witness and name them, with their friends in the gallery | chance: 35 | grants: good name in town | drops_if_fails: kind:community
works: {Ns} evidence holds under every question, both are convicted, and the town speaks of {N} as someone who stood up when it counted.
works: The case is won on {Ns} word, and people on the street stop {N} to shake hands.
fails: The case collapses on a technicality, the friends of the two make life awkward, and {N} drops out of every club and group on that side of town.
fails: The jury does not believe {N}, the gallery jeers on the way out, and {N} gives up the clubs and evenings that took {N} past that bridge.

